  "job_B21.2.1.2.1_20251003_114544": {
    "text": "\u00deas l\u00e6cedomas belimpa\u00f0 to eallum inno\u00fea mettrymnessum.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe magan sare, ealra X, & gif se maga a\u00feened sie & hw\u00e6t he \u00feicgean scyle on \u00fe\u00e6re adle.\nL\u00e6cedomas be geswelle & sare \u00fe\u00e6s magan, hu him mon scyle blod l\u00e6tan.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe heardum swyle \u00fe\u00e6s magan & smerenessa & hw\u00e6t he \u00feicgean scyle.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe magan a\u00feundenesse & hw\u00e6t he on \u00fe\u00e6re adle \u00feicge.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe unluste & wl\u00e6tan \u00fee of magan cym\u00f0 & hw\u00e6t he \u00feicgean scyle, IIII cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 adeadodum magan & gif he forsogen sie & tacn adeadodes magan, hu \u00fe\u00e6t ne gemylt\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe sare & unluste \u00fe\u00e6s magan se \u00fee ne m\u00e6g ne mid mete ne mid drincan beon gelacnod &\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe inwunde magan.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 wl\u00e6ttan & to h\u00e6tenne untrumne magan.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe a\u00feundenesse magan windigre & e\u00feunge.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe spiw\u00fean & wi\u00fe \u00feon \u00f0e him mete under gewunian nelle.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe magan springe.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00f0 eallum magan untrumnessum.\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s magan springe \u00feonne \u00feurh mu\u00fe bitere hr\u00e6c\u00f0 o\u00fe\u00fee bealcet o\u00fe\u00fee him on \u00feam magan\nL\u00e6cedomas & tacn \u00fe\u00e6s hatan omihtan magan, ungemet f\u00e6sta, & \u00fe\u00e6s ungesceadlice cealdan magan;\nL\u00e6cecr\u00e6ftas be lifre missenlice gecyndo & adlum & hu hio on \u00fea swi\u00f0ran sidan a\u00feened bi\u00fe o\u00fe \u00feone\nL\u00e6cas l\u00e6ra\u00f0 \u00feisne l\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe lifre swyle & a\u00feundenesse.\nL\u00e6ceas secgea\u00fe \u00feas tacn be aswollenre & gewundadre lifre & l\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 \u00feon & be \u00fe\u00e6re lifre\nL\u00e6cas l\u00e6ra\u00f0 \u00feis wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re lifre wunde \u00feonne se swyle ge wyrms tobyrst.\nL\u00e6cedomas & tacn aheardodre lifre & ablawenre on manigfealde wisan, ge on \u00feam l\u00e6ppum ge on \u00feam\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re gefelan heardnesse \u00fe\u00e6re lifre & sealfa & wyrtdrencas o\u00fe\u00fee gif hio tobyrst &\nL\u00e6cedomas hw\u00e6t him sie to forganne on liferadle, hw\u00e6t him sie to healdanne, ge on l\u00e6cedomum ge on\nL\u00e6cedomas & wyrtdrencas wi\u00fe eallum lifer w\u00e6rcum, ealra \u00fereotyne, & gif lifer weaxe.\nL\u00e6cas eac be eallum wambe co\u00feum & adlum sweotol tacn fundon & l\u00e6cedomas & hu mon \u00fea yfelan\nL\u00e6cedomas gif sio wamb wund bi\u00f0, hu \u00fe\u00e6t mon ongitan m\u00e6ge & gelacnian, V cr\u00e6ftas.\nL\u00e6cedomas be wambe missenlicre gecyndo o\u00fe\u00fee misbyrdo, hu \u00fe\u00e6t mon m\u00e6ge ongitan & gelacnian &\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feon \u00fee monnes \u00fe\u00e6t uferre hrif sie gefylled wi\u00f0 yfelre w\u00e6tan & be windigre wambe.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feon \u00fee mete untela mylte & cirre on fule & yfle w\u00e6tan o\u00fe\u00fee scittan.\nL\u00e6cedomas gif \u00feu wille \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein wamb sie simle gesund & be co\u00f0e & sare be wambe co\u00f0e & innefaran\nL\u00e6cedomas & tacnung on \u00feam roppe & sm\u00e6l \u00feearme & on utgonge, hu hie \u00ferowia\u00f0 orm\u00e6tne \u00feurst &\nL\u00e6cedomas hu mon swa geradne man lacnian scule ge mid blodl\u00e6se & sealfe & ba\u00f0o & lacnung on\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re frecnan co\u00f0e \u00fee se mon his utgang \u00feurh \u00f0one mu\u00f0 him fram wyrp\u00f0 & aspiwan\nL\u00e6cedomas & be \u00fe\u00e6s mannes mihtum sceal mon \u00fea l\u00e6cedomas sellan \u00fee \u00feonne gefoge synd, ge heafde\nL\u00e6cedomas be cilda oferfyllo & wambe & gif him mete tela ne mylte & him swat ofga & stince fule.\nL\u00e6cedomas be miltew\u00e6rce & \u00fe\u00e6t he bi\u00f0 on \u00fea winstran sidan & tacn \u00f0\u00e6re adle, hu higelease hi beo\u00f0,\nL\u00e6cedomas hu mon scyle \u00feone monnan innan & utan mid cealdum & hatum l\u00e6cedomum lacnian &\nL\u00e6cedomas hu mon sceal \u00fea w\u00e6tan & wonsceafta utan lacnian & be \u00feam w\u00e6tum yflum \u00fe\u00e6s miltes &\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe windigre a\u00feundenesse \u00fe\u00e6s miltes, sio cym\u00f0 of \u00e6pla \u00e6te & hnuta & pysena & huniges\nL\u00e6cedomas be ablawunge & aheardunge \u00fe\u00e6s blodes on \u00feam milte.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re heardnesse & sare miltes & hu mon m\u00e6g swines bl\u00e6dran mid ecede gefyldre\nL\u00e6cedomas gif omihtre blod & yfele w\u00e6tan on \u00feam milte syn \u00feindende, \u00feonne sceal him mon blod\nL\u00e6cedomas hw\u00e6t him on \u00fe\u00e6re adle to \u00feicgenne sie hw\u00e6t to forganne.\nL\u00e6cedom, eft, se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t yfel uttih\u00f0 of \u00feam milte, swi\u00f0e \u00e6\u00feele, & se eac deah wi\u00fe magan ablawunge &\nL\u00e6cedomas & swi\u00f0drenc wi\u00fe aswollenum.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe gehw\u00e6\u00feerre sidan sare & tacn wundorlicu hwanan sio cume & hu sio adl toweard sie\nL\u00e6cedomas \u00fea \u00f0e \u00feynnunge h\u00e6bben & smalunge m\u00e6gen, \u00feam lichoman \u00fee \u00fea h\u00e6to medmicle o\u00fe\u00fee\nL\u00e6cedomas selran gif \u00feas o\u00fere helpe ne syn, hu him mon eac blod scyle l\u00e6tan.\nL\u00e6cedomas & weax sealfa & scearpunga wi\u00fe sidan sare & hw\u00e6t he \u00feicgean scyle.\nL\u00e6cedomas eft wi\u00f0 sidan sare.\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 lungenadle & la\u00felicu tacn, hwanan sio adl cume & hu mon lacnian scyle, drencas &\nL\u00e6cedomas & spiwedrencas mannum to h\u00e6le & gif man hine ofer gemet brece to spiwanne & eft wece\nL\u00e6cedomas & leohte drencas mannum to h\u00e6lo & unspiule drenceas wi\u00fe untrumum inno\u00feum, eahta\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas wi\u00f0 instice & gif stice butan inno\u00fee sie.\nL\u00e6cedomas & drencas gif mon innan forh\u00e6fd sie & wi\u00fe inco\u00fee & f\u00e6r co\u00fee.\nL\u00e6cedomas gif mon sie on utw\u00e6rce & tacn be utsihte, ge on \u00feam uferran hrife ge on \u00feam ni\u00feerran, &\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feearmes utgange & gif men bilyhte sie ymb \u00feone \u00feearm & wi\u00f0 bl\u00e6c \u00feearmes utgange,\nL\u00e6cedomas be \u00fe\u00e6re adle \u00fee stanas on men innan geweaxen on \u00fe\u00e6re bl\u00e6dran o\u00f0\u00f0e elles hw\u00e6r & tacn\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re healfdeadan adle & hwanan sio cume & hu mon lacnian scyle, sealfa & onlegena\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe wifa gecyndum forsetenum & eallum wifa tydernessum, gif wif bearn ne m\u00e6ge\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re geolwan adle & wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m miclan lice & dolhdrencas twegen & o\u00feer m\u00e6g wi\u00fe\nL\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe miclum heafod ece & w\u00e6rce & sealf to \u00feon ilcan & leah & eagsealfa & gebed to\nL\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe \u00feeoradle & wi\u00fe lungenadle & wi\u00fe utw\u00e6rce & gif mon blode spiwe & wi\u00fe blodryne & gif\nL\u00e6cedom, se monian wi\u00fe inno\u00fees forh\u00e6fdnesse & gutomon wi\u00f0 milte w\u00e6rce & stice & spican wi\u00fe\nL\u00e6cedom gif hors sie ofscoten & wi\u00fe utw\u00e6rce & gif utgang forseten sie & wi\u00fe lenctenadle, eft, wi\u00fe\nBe \u00feam stane \u00fee gagates hatte.\nBe w\u00e6ge eles & o\u00feerra missenlicra \u00feinga.",
